  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 5</div>
